join strix center
strix: [wave amp=50 freq=5.0 connected=1]Hello[/wave], and welcome to my game, [n+][b][wave amp=50 freq=5.0 connected=1]the world's easiest game![/wave][/b]
strix: You're going to have so much fun here!
label Questions
- Who are you? | [if {know_strix_name} == false] [else="hide"]
	set {strix.name} = {strix.regular_name}
	set {know_strix_name} = true
