if {know_strix_name} == false:
	set {strix.name} = {strix.regular_name}
	set {know_strix_name} = true
	strix: I'm Strix and I've got you in for a [b][wave amp=50 freq=5.0 connected=1]doozy[/wave][/b] of excitement!
strix: The game is very simple. There's a timer for ten seconds and all you have to do...[n+] is [b]just wait for it to finish![/b]
strix: Yes, it's that simple![n+] There is [i]one[/i] catch tho...
strix: I couldn't afford to make a new game so I had to steal[aa=0]
strix: [speed=0]I couldn't afford to make a new game so I had to[speed] [i]borrow[/i] an unfinished one from someone else.
strix: [b][i]BUT[/i][/b], I made it better and [n+][wave amp=50 freq=5.0 connected=1][i]easy.[/i][/wave]
strix: [b][i]HOWEVER[/i][/b], it came with this [b]stupid button[/b] I can't get rid of.
strix: The [shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1][b]bad[/b][/shake] thing is that whenever you press the button,[speed=3][n+][shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1][b]very bad things[/b][/shake][speed] happen.
strix: [speed=0][shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1][b]Very bad things![/b][/shake][speed][pause=0.4] You [b]don't[/b] want to find out!
strix: So basically,[pause=0.4] don't press the button![n+] That's [b]all[/b] you have to do!
strix: Just wait for ten seconds and...
audio -
strix: [shake rate=25.0 level=10 connected=1][b]DON'T![n+] PRESS![n+] THE![n+] BUTTON![/b][/shake]
audio -
strix: [font_size=15][i]Damn it, I made the game start a–[/i][/font_size] I mean...
strix: I mean I made the game start so you can finally enjoy!
audio -
strix: Have fun!